flowchart TD
    Start([专注开始]) --> StartService[启动前台服务<br/>ForegroundService]
    StartService --> ShowNotif[显示持续性通知<br/>Notification]
    ShowNotif --> BoostPriority[进程oom_adj值<br/>提升到前台级别]
    BoostPriority --> AcquireLock[获取PARTIAL_WAKE_LOCK<br/>唤醒锁]
    AcquireLock --> PreventSleep[阻止CPU进入<br/>深度休眠]
    PreventSleep --> SetAlarm[使用setExactAndAllowWhileIdle<br/>调度Alarm]
    SetAlarm --> CheckDoze{系统进入<br/>Doze模式?}
    
    CheckDoze -->|是| AlarmWhitelist[Alarm仍可触发<br/>白名单机制]
    CheckDoze -->|否| NormalRun1[正常运行]
    
    AlarmWhitelist --> CheckMemory{系统内存<br/>压力大?}
    NormalRun1 --> CheckMemory
    
    CheckMemory -->|是| HighPriority[前台服务优先级高<br/>不易被杀]
    CheckMemory -->|否| NormalRun2[正常运行]
    
    HighPriority --> CheckKilled{服务被<br/>系统终止?}
    NormalRun2 --> CheckKilled
    
    CheckKilled -->|是| AutoRestart[START_STICKY标志<br/>自动重启]
    CheckKilled -->|否| Continue[继续运行]
    
    AutoRestart --> Continue
    Continue --> FocusEnd{专注结束?}
    
    FocusEnd -->|否| CheckDoze
    FocusEnd -->|是| ReleaseLock[释放WakeLock]
    
    ReleaseLock --> StopService[停止前台服务]
    StopService --> RemoveNotif[移除通知]
    RemoveNotif --> End([结束])
    
    style Start fill:#00ff9f,stroke:#00ff9f,color:#000
    style CheckDoze fill:#b026ff,stroke:#b026ff,color:#fff
    style CheckMemory fill:#b026ff,stroke:#b026ff,color:#fff
    style CheckKilled fill:#b026ff,stroke:#b026ff,color:#fff
    style FocusEnd fill:#b026ff,stroke:#b026ff,color:#fff
    style AutoRestart fill:#ffd93d,stroke:#ffd93d,color:#000
    style HighPriority fill:#6bcf7f,stroke:#6bcf7f,color:#000
    style End fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    
    Note1["非Root环境局限性:<br/>厂商定制ROM可能<br/>实施更激进的后台查杀"]
    
    style Note1 fill:#1a1a2e,stroke:#ff6b6b,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
